+"""
+The datastore's client registries: what this project stores, and the per-table facts the generic
+datastore layer (``Datastore/SQL``, ``Datastore/store_reader.py``, ``Datastore/store_inventory.py``)
+is given rather than imports.
+
+- ``factories``: the storable classes, each name mapped to its factory. ``main.py`` and the extract
+  scripts pass it to ``ShardedPool``; the reader and the inventory are given it too.
+- ``drop_groups``: the ``--drop`` actions, each mapped to the tables it drops. ``tables_to_drop``
+  turns a list of actions into the tables; the layer orders them by foreign key.
+- ``serial_batch_sizes``: how many serials a client leases from the broker at a time, per table.
+  A table not named here leases the layer's default.
